  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6077fc8eaba1b826bd2c292",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后300米处在前方\\n且与最前方的马娘距离很近或是领头时\\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af06b7f998a09bbd0126393d30443b406d00ab68eae7bca882d39a3e3fe146d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100291"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100291"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e50db8dafecc20f8bed25063",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越并身处前方时\\n最终直线上会爆发出强烈的意志\\n使得速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "207dab470a722b28df5e1d672796fda34b1ec2a19eb17cede99b4b89eaef7542",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100301"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135bb7911e65bbff94d6638a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "左右移动时加速度提升\\n并且小幅提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "618841073921b707ac5ad9e9f6272f444e69a03f893283481d7df25bef2d580b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100301111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3f886183374860c20023a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,一段时间内路线选择\\n变得更明智\\n并且速度与加速度小幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0ac0a0f818f43ac82a68905e933fd93f4661099e79f06a87b6409095d6ac68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100301211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c129cd67bfdca2b9b74032",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘开始时\\n若位于前方则提升加速度\\n此外，若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则向前突进＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d947a9b1d465443ac375a0fc2fb1062e13cc5fb8184cb9358183a262bbee335a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301311"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100301311"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bdbbfe01e7aa9007f58bc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘身处前方时\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a01ef98e50787be1e9ec371b3ec4723ced444df829236db71d8caca1898a5dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100302111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8abceb92abd33011bc14983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "左右移动时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e8b765b529e296b3c7e1e8696209827e2f8d1d47fad1e0987f4d288d714bd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100302211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a318337a2c5a8a52b47d30d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时提高加速度\\n若在2400m～2500m的比赛中耐力数值十分高\\n则在终盘初段更早时间内大幅提升加速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4b571f0afe7f6d4a7bf3c1ce44f04fcdec3e9f6920945dede80bb6861f8b00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100303111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:308c1267e26d56a4e4fda35a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于前方\\n则回复少量体力并提升少量速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed94e83230802bb7a55d29d88776a1dec6cb229f35a769f724c647678ffc5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100303211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce5102ad7efb309a98b86f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于前方时\\n稍微消耗体力使速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c690d671aae0a8767b98953e490fc87723885da2bf0244bd4cef636bfbd67e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100303221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100303221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae2e18d7f988d205c1f53fb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300m左右处于前方的话提高速度\\n若刚好上完坡\\n则速度大幅提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2dda1b4551432eadb3cc1c01461f186af6bbf8132f82cf5b8fb7d7bd01c88e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100311"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100311"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95bf5a9ee61282d832143a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n持久力恢复\\n且短时间内稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ac82462a200d2dc59571f770829f334b6d4b7024c376705e135a31b57d65d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100321"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100321"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5b58bcfe1aba0d089a942b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线被前方拉开距离时\\n会如同得到星之引导一般加快速度\\n此时若靠近最后方的话速度会大幅上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1335c1dbcd8113ea0e6469f52a662fa61899e98bc7596f6075ba9040fedb7c32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100331"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100331"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a63a51302f9759408f8d8320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前半,一直位于队伍中后方等待时机的话\\n在名次争夺时,将展现出江户之子的潜力\\n速度大幅上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a541c516651bec90ccb8795f155f2eb41cbe10682a6d121f580fae10390966",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100341"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100341"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5deb0e37b79e0524073b5a67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n涌现出不服输的强烈求胜心,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d62348f838c39ffb479265bdf8a754e1644bd4ee99f20b1a5ab8bb0f422c763",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100351"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100351"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a858b37ced277b1ad1c1e501",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后若处于队伍中部靠近内埒一侧\\n则会找到通往胜利的道路,在最终直线\\n提高速度,容易找到好路线",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad90af65c0dcce335baa2470b9f62bac0f84e82f4ff172c9a868901c3138fdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100361"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100361"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11808d53d950c1bbc4473056",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是冷静地进行比赛,并在最终直线上位于\\n第三名以后的话,速度提升。若是持续\\n身处中团的话,变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "729ad7fba47cec0dc896b9166b17c5968e5d9f01058c53554c15c6e06768ead4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100371"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100371"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fafa4f7e9a1c01ea7006b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘附近处于好位置时\\n赶超的话就会充满气势的开始前进",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e1e7b85c168a604b20059d402600bdfd420e43ce345ec1ad922346bd5b83e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100381"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100381"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45835f6892826f9c695321f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行名次争夺时\\n可爱地飞奔提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4d83e35df040e3199df13ceb480c1b769bcd3a043866d29bb9871e40a7311e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100391"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100391"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a8b89d9e1b69845d964e4dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于中间集团并开始发力时\\n充分发挥实力\\n速度逐渐少量提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69b8406530ae18323c919b10344286e5311a5f8a53332ef3473c2b69d0250fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100401"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41ea6f0534048ec02e3bcd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f925b4c9f309147e6bd9b7901d3f48a8d63465b88b5235af652396a47f89b604",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ccdd2c01b9dab562aefa941",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半领先时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "615842181811577381dd16baef5b3f4f7c977cbf311a0864936680610e5416f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae8a57d1a4628dbb8bb326f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘被追近时\\n会在一段时间内向前冲出＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "861d3fa7b6737ffa9d2120df523f2ce25b8a1091fc7de0e320b26f26d7f7aa6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100401221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100401221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3278384aad428ce3e617326",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处上坡时,大量回复持久力\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2a4e7049636557bbd9eabef98be4f4dc529de6cd167ab31c39bec1e3def8eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100402111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac1c089255cb41eca8afae4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在上坡略微回复持久力\n并向前突进<领放·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "104d7f2ad664dcd3e8edd9a8b8220d01c42045d27fc569745f95c2ce1ee90223",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100402121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0f648723b74126babd8646",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若位于前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b411601a49d2564078748dd1bb6fbb40b2ec74b792b490ff9b78243e8ecd2596",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100402211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100402211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a25cd12b4b7e71d5a6ee8fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备超越或者被逼近时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f9449d6751a460947f9b5ee4c64fc5155b6db95d6722beadf64c4299b607d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100403111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100403111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91b2ce4eda23efcbf085280c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段被逼近时\\n大幅向前突进＜领放・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "86fef1a0203baa83faa636ad0fd145baf1df491068ed1ee5d36afa8df765e39f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100403211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100403211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340ee4ee62db238e6e7a5c83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n发挥爆进之力,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca029c93cf0b16a5d21764c4ad0dadc7a969dd72f0d4dcaea09c2b7f1fd3567",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100411"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100411"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb305fcf4130aa3188282fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余200m处自身不在领头位置\\n距离领头4马身以内时速度提升\\n距离2马身以内时速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8985caffefd8a8cd0d77ba40de4c77a10c27ee0cb085cc292c86f19d406ba293",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100421"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100421"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39bcb86fbe6ed04d7f3c5f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名次争夺时,速度稍稍上升\\n若是身处沙土比赛,则会以要噬咬前方选手般\\n的气势进一步提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "22b6c85fc42f400d28e1a5467b535266a193e2ad87dfde07616460405a647517",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100431"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100431"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92248df88779e21cddbc6d73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入最终弯道前能一直保持冷静\\n在后方等待机会的话,会在距离终点剩余300m处\\n发动加速魔法,速度持续上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e033dfe05fc045e02fac69362278a87d990ca1186f33faea6663f74d368f42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100441"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100441"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b53aab8de5f20908bad54c82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100451"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100451"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4d36524d12aefc221eb1c23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线位于前方\\n并被后面的马娘拉近距离时\\n绝不让步的想法将会化作动力",
      "source_fingerprint": "73db05e4deb762d6e62794bed18ffd1bb0ef9f95c9cf6140539c1fd9584d5bcf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100461"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100461"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629da9be1f97acb4b30ca969",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘阶段剩余400m处位于前方时\\n速度提升,且在GⅠ比赛\\n等大舞台上取得高人气时,速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d822f9128917a15f5176ee4a821434bb99bcab3d1279b60e7dba285f24d02ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100471"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100471"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc5218f532d74ac954a2a59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终直线上身处前方\\n完成超越或是即将被超越时\\n速度会随兴致一起提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e5c4e82cdbf9ccfc84c9997d6194496fa9b6ca2813feca9f69cc2941412dc1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100481"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100481"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651bb573efeddff6f402abb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后准备超越前方马娘时\\n将在剩余400m以后的好位置处提高速度\\n人气较低的时候速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "949bf7491215935fd69cc3634d60805c0f38608ab9ad1202d24c4c344b1052bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100491"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100491"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4363d50c8f71c74c626084b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从中间梯队向前突进时\\n以凌厉的攻势加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "87b14b983e23bfda1e79a0f6547c66a34c4d7a5af1324643ff7f4d3aa28c04a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100501"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d095441986533356d2e137aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进行赶超时,速度大幅提升\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c119a06f54ae59b50e843cc5ea7e649ca396e31e3556322dd07524f2b68598",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100501111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0976282c7c3c875e5ffd11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b6d2825a71c02b64dc3c2e5b575a1babd066fb8e64a633c5c1e1da57b1b2ee7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100501211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3518acdd36b927d08f35f91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n稍微恢复耐力并提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7e643bdf92660bbe3eac20bbad3d11569bcd9b2a695159ba33f1389820d272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100501221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100501221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771e7ca38dfaa596c91cd55f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n剥夺身后焦躁的赛马娘的持久力\\n提升自己的速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "199c0d9f08c694f746f282385df0721a5af437dc947933c84363800652c4a5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100502111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20155a7286dba49b68c55c5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道处速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f53460263245cec9620e8dad1058318f7755d9de9102b26bd73200123c4201c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100502121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a021884a314806cd71b20e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d8211d02851abab35bd903734e4d87204c6e814fe0fa9c70bc14df1711ed0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100502211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100502211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:412f11eb527d73fcbacd03aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入比赛后半段时极大幅度向前突进\n在中山赛场且耐力充足时\n随后的全速冲刺阶段将稍微提升冲刺性能\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb8e48635fc933388bc12346969beb5e25336115186758af2d8cb70210a19fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100503111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100503111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076d783a3568ec486173bd4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终盘以后的最终弯道或中山赛场的终盘以后弯道上\n处于中间集团及以前时加速度提升\n随后在最终直线上速度稍微提升\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ad6d891df94d8ab1ce06e92cbbd50178ba508e1205217a074971f2c1fff937",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100503211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100503211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1141795528b04e6367b30b62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘经过弯道竞争\\n且终盘的最终弯道过半后自身占据好位置时\\n提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "079aa7ce4ff38cba75369c588fc61a44be69bf733d268b11307aceb76ce157fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100511"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100511"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56983285d245638a3251fe0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于靠后位置时\\n会看着附近的赛马娘并恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e471b891cacb2cbbcfe4543d6365658e0c3f76fbd05132f0a15e3e1bf506e293",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100521"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100521"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380f367f2c419e7500e6ef7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘处于最终弯道且身处后方向前逼近时\\n短时间内加速度提升,每次超越其他马娘\\n都会增强效果并刷新时间,最多增强三次",
      "source_fingerprint": "c33faab4c2622ad170e37451e419a01343f84245702724402084a22c4a231e43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100531"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100531"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:541cf4f4581b1bd00ade93ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段若从后方进行了超越\\n剩余150m后自身位于前方时\\n在短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbafea735c34900460837dec2417db383092f18613376b228f6fc232ad0cdba5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100541"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100541"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d44567e8f0d3628308b51e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中场附近位于队伍中间且\\n附近有其他赛马娘时,速度提升\\n如果视野内有4人以上的赛马娘则效果增强",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4eabcc3075228c02c27db802ac0b666ff0266294674491c175a2a857a454e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100551"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100551"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf60c11682395e8ea654a00b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘前方受阻时\\n能够借助预言之力开辟道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "7faf7001c95398ff4f3f03bf264663b1c7fc6fe4636ef7c1719b105570651bd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100561"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100561"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a56d299023d867ae9f8bbfbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛即将进入终盘时的某刻位于后方时\\n速度持续上升。若是在中长距离比赛中\\n距离领先位置越远则效果越强",
      "source_fingerprint": "266151786cd065bbad05c05fac67bcea22312698e2a51c733a86b6a4732d7e7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100571"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100571"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8aa9b64718c15b363788a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时\\n会以永不放弃之心向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "557e1b41d5f085f623324830121bea3bfda9ecb1a1bbd9df72aabb9a1c33813f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100581"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100581"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c1419c18f1576a8e4ecf0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "保持冷静进入中盘并准备发力时\\n或是在终盘胜负关键的弯道\\n位于中部梯队时,会振作精神提升加速力",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eecd7351bbf2624b1ce7a3312a7a0a56dd75c612f3475aef19d8402b82b82e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100591"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100591"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfeb0628bb7f95fc079e6b90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘处于第三名快要输掉的时候\\n激发潜藏的昂扬斗志,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a5f1420dfe2efcdeea52bcf95cbb06459dc90735aa8af2824c994478405d56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100601"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857e7756fec354c18c754444",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "364ba72a395d48d1b7cd12f9cf52f138ad9d93164cc8977206eaaaa3110ac36c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100601111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ee6a4332770e4d07d40fea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘稍微回复体力\\n并提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8baa2e78e20c7d6152c287f90284173e4081d89997c9560a74f0059fe510ca82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100601121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:881e85d021fee1acf67bc397",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在弯道上提升加速度\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "428166ffb7647066972a3313f1786ecfe6d3caf9d8990be0ede53993d68ba769",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100601211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef96694dc256c38f9e6d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "364ba72a395d48d1b7cd12f9cf52f138ad9d93164cc8977206eaaaa3110ac36c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100602111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100602111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a2fc439f49aae363dd9680",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内道\\n则提升速度并稍微回复持久力\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "85da4db05356a174e4e187285e4938d315c843936a5866aa661f30b9c4529647",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100602211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100602211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70e898bbcccd86e3e5398fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时提升速度\n之后若正在进行比拼\n则在剩余200m地点略微提升速度<英里/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "93894c990dee56940a29cbf6fd12a133d781019fa2dbf75166d4e864c35e47d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100603111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4495b9455e5fa663894a4812",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是有马纪念赛道则终盘提升加速度，\n比赛终盘迫近时若位于领头或\n紧跟在领头4马身以内则大幅提升<先行·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "5886358b480e4c3a01980f8f972efc080b5b4091681eb48a0d71109a39ed512f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100603211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8d9791ebf36d7b5e520979",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于前方时加速度\n大幅提升，比赛终盘迫近时若位于领头或\n紧跟在领头4马身以内则极大提升<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c7f88a896049d292ffd333ec236fbe5b700de68ebd9115f3dc786852610170",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100603221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c3a80c52616e603d488eef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够冷静地进行比赛的规划时\\n就能够在最后200米发挥实力,大幅加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdefbed2b57ee35b79b7eecbce81b6563f6e361b0a3a6effe165b2159056f9f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100611"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100611"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03e8f3eb0cee8c0d3c2e86a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中期左右处于队伍中团时\\n重新振作,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "188ffc3e04a40918d2b302180751f9f5ce40869673a65582598f0a91a9ee67b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100621"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100621"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da05926e41fb4d32ca7461d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a61747bc7d5a82c17524c16c23b18aef10b67d814704bc7fc90d9c374a39cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100631"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100631"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea54f51a13dfc660641bfd24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从起跑到比赛后半程一直保持在前列的话\\n心情将变得超嗨\\n回复持久力且速度逐渐上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b450ddacdeb27a6345b9e72c864c849a35369b0dbe1d53d24be51ba83b098b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100641"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100641"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f7ee050d2b64e6f95bea36d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则速度少量持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6719aa5ababc328c98292546e852ab9939eb84c9fe5ce716f46308e9bf16bfb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100651"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100651"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352dfb60f1f6491d3b915015",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中盘中段处于领头位置时\\n超长时间内速度持续稍微上升\\n但终盘末段时会微幅逆喷射",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f61438830319135f63c8ee3a3a5bdaacbc4868fec61db72c0577ce16aaa008",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100661"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100661"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70752a2efafa1745d9e4b000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线时,若处于好位置\\n则会怀抱坚强的意志来加快速度\\n若接近领头马娘的话则会大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "49579c1b9d5bcd6d774a8881caf0568b3e162108bfd7be88ce15886f703aef1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100671"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100671"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1211d34271602f74d679b74d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "位于前方,比赛后半的\\n第3弯道中速度稍微提高\\n或者在终盘的看台对面直线赛道上向前强力冲刺",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe67bf16b600a0b84e4f71db7c08dc0940554e0cdda9859e1ce23bf71256e756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100681"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100681"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f1f9a58725f855995c6e8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩余300米处于有利位置\\n且与前方赛马娘距离近时\\n强烈的信念将绽放,提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "28670afdbd6cc16c6c9b1e951d05c10ad447becf44a04dc1303b9231cf9e1f8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100691"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100691"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a9c093619890db8b8ed53be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在剩余800m处位于队伍中间时\\n稍微提升加速度,若在2400m的比赛中\\n取得高人气则大幅提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "680ade38f5115fbdcda85131b320912fe56de78476f57f3f116f8181caabe5f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100701"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaa00d3d1a4df6b6c62b694",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "左右移动时,视野小幅变宽广\\n并且稍微回复持久力\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7f5c1726165eeeacb48215c69a8bdc8d59c2c2bf4a167ca18d9cc21752230c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bcd484fcbb19ee120d6fdd6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在下坡时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47c7e660ce488d6ed02afe65c316f267563222a006a763d56e6a9678c99e71c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100701211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f1b65c2b975a9e1c0dcb62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内侧\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "43ad05462332e7e395ed9a903165fd06598538b7eca0a23c2931da2bd3d38927",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100702111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdb4ba03c2650f6c8aecfcb6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae5ae6b4cafa1681f3f7f297ad191beb904f6a7abe67e1e047d4a31cf5bcbc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100702211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cff912d07bda380c1fa698f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0344efc3875e3615bed95fb82d95c1e3e1fc23f13d8d59181a8c2a9a42ef608c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100702221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd20ef03b2efbae3996a1f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线上加速度提升\\n并在最终直线上速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "820c61e810929f5bd663aee16c2e554d6a854272ae10170de1a1890932a7b6c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100703111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/100703111"
    }
  ]
